<h1>Release <em>notes</em> for v2</h1>
<p>This release makes <strong>operations</strong> carry their type &amp; removes <code>x.y</code> calls. See <a href="docs/tutorial.md">the tutorial</a> for &lt;details&gt;.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Added <code>Array.tally</code></li>
  <li>Fixed <strong>nil</strong> hints</li>
  <li>Faster <em>startup</em></li>
</ul>
<ol>
  <li>Install</li>
  <li>Run <code>sake --strict=0 a.sake</code></li>
</ol>
<blockquote>Types belong on operations, not on variables.</blockquote>
<pre><code>puts(String.upcase("&lt;b&gt;"))
  # indented &amp; kept</code></pre>
<p>Final words.</p>
